# Markdown note standards

- Add valid YAML frontmatter to functional notes; use existing property values and types.
- Use one H1 matching the note title, followed by meaningful H2 sections.
- Prefer `[[Note Name]]` links over hard-coded vault-relative Markdown links.
- Do not create a link to a nonexistent note unless it is intentionally a future daily note or documented placeholder.
- Write actionable tasks as `- [ ]`; add `📅 YYYY-MM-DD` when a due date exists.
- Keep templates generic and use QuickAdd tokens for prompts and Templater for computed values.
- Exclude `99_Templates` from Dataview queries unless templates are the intended result.
